        ],
        "@modelcontextprotocol/server-sequential-thinking": [
          "sequentialthinking"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "idx": 267,
      "question": "I need to implement an error log aggregator feature that processes our Ableton logs from the /logs directory. First, analyze what's required to parse the error patterns from the existing log files, then break this down into manageable tasks. Track these in my work.md file - we should prioritize the core parsing functionality before the visualization components.",
